    isCentered: 0
    audio: {fileID: 0}
    dialogue: All spells require Dan, the essence of life. When a creature dies,
      its Dan dissipates into the environment. Yet if you preserve the flesh, its
      Dan remains concentrated. I have added a compartment in your sack, inscribed
      with a rune that slows decay. Keep the flesh of your kills there. Whenever
      you cast a spell, Dan shall be drawn from these tissues.
